Horizontal Pod Autoscaler Task
Create a Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA) named mrapp in the autoscaler namespace.

The HPA must target the existing Deployment mrapp running in the same namespace.

Configure the autoscaler with the following requirements:

Target average CPU utilization: 50% per pod
Minimum replicas: 1
Maximum replicas: 4
Downscale stabilization window: 30 seconds


